#: includes/fixes/class-fix-img-alt-empty-library.php:51
msgid "Empty image alt text from the Media Library"
msgstr ""

#: includes/fixes/class-fix-img-alt-empty-library.php:60
msgid "Replaces an empty alt attribute (alt=\"\") with the alt text saved in the Media Library. Starts Off: the block editor writes alt=\"\" for images whose alt text was left empty when they were inserted, which is also how an author marks an image as decorative, so this fix can undo a deliberate choice. Check what it would change in a report before you turn it on. An image the page names only by its address, without the image id the editor adds, is repaired once a scan or \"View repaired\" has looked it up."
msgstr ""

#: includes/fixes/class-fix-img-alt-library.php:50
msgid "Missing image alt text from the Media Library"
msgstr ""

#: includes/fixes/class-fix-img-alt-library.php:59
msgid "Gives images that have no alt attribute the alt text saved for them in the Media Library. Images whose Media Library alt text is empty are listed in the report instead. An image the page names only by its address, without the image id the editor adds, is repaired once a scan or \"View repaired\" has looked it up."
msgstr ""

#: includes/fixes/class-fix-img-in-named-control.php:49
msgid "Images inside named links and buttons"
msgstr ""

#: includes/fixes/class-fix-img-in-named-control.php:58
msgid "Gives an image without alt text inside a link or button that already has text an empty alt (alt=\"\"), so screen readers neither read the file name nor repeat the link text."
msgstr ""

